 "description": "What if you had to survive 30 days in a hotel full of zombies? What if you were born in ancient Rome, lived as a caveman, or woke up as a billionaire with nothing left?\n\nThis channel is animated \"What If\" and POV stories that put YOU inside the scenario. Every video is a 2D animated survival story, history story or success story, told step by step: what you would eat, where you would sleep, how long you would last, and what it would cost.\n\nYou'll find:\n• Survival stories: zombie apocalypse, nuclear bunker, desert island, the wild, natural disasters\n• History: life in ancient Egypt, Rome, medieval times, the Stone Age\n• Money and success: going from zero to millionaire, rich vs poor, how fortunes are made and lost\n• Psychology and the human body: what happens to your brain and body when you push the limits\n\nWhat would YOU do? Subscribe and turn on notifications so you don't miss the next scenario.\n",
